OL,3,GNEWSACharity launched to help women
OL,4,Awith addiction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new charity aiming to support women
OL,7,Faffected by addiction and help them
OL,8,Ffeel less alone during recovery has
OL,9,Flaunched.
OL,11,FLou's Lighthouse, based in Oxford,
OL,12,Ffinds them temporary accommodation and
OL,13,Fprovides daily check-ins along with
OL,14,Flife skills workshops.
OL,16,FIts mission statement is to "provide
OL,17,Fsafe, stable homes where women affected
OL,18,Fby addiction can heal, grow and rebuild
OL,19,Ftheir lives".
